# Train a neural network in 5 mins

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:axon, "~> 0.6"},
  {:exla, "~> 0.6"},
  {:nx, "~> 0.10"},
  {:scidata, "~> 0.1.11"},
  :kino
])
```

## The Data

```elixir
{images, labels} = Scidata.MNIST.download()
```

```elixir
# create a tensor
images_tensor = 
  {images_data, image_type, images_shape} = images
  images_data
  |> Nx.from_binary(image_type)
  |> Nx.reshape(images_shape)
  |> Nx.divide(255)
  |> Nx.reshape({60_000, :auto})
```

References:

* [Train a Neural Network in Minutes with Elixir & Axon](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xk1WPGKaDBg)
